							"type": "10",
							"modifier": 6
						}
					],
					"usage_notes": "Vorpal Tusks (16): thrust 3d+2(10) cutting, Reach C-1. The razor boar may gore with both tusks as a single attack; if it hits, figure damage for each tusk separately. They have DR 6. If the boar loses one tusk, it may still attack with the other. The boar can parry with its tusks. The tusks always do damage to the opponent’s weapon on a successful parry, or when they are parried."
				},
